Hi Alex,

Thank you for making time today. Ahead of our call at 1:30pm UK time, here is=
 where we are with hosted payments.

Dojo's hosted checkout is now built into our online menu (menu.vesopa.com), s=
o customers can order from their table and pay securely on Dojo's page. We wo=
uld like to take the same approach to the till and to our Android and iOS app=
s, and to agree the right way to do it with you.

What is in place today:
- Online menu (live): customers pay on Dojo's hosted checkout before the orde=
r is sent. The till and kitchen only see it once Dojo confirms the payment.
- Back office switch (live): each venue turns it on in its online menu settin=
gs, and can make card payment the only way to order.
- Safe by design (live): the result is always read from the payment intent, n=
ever the redirect. Failed or abandoned payments cancel the order.
- Match tickets and memberships: already paid on Dojo's hosted checkout.
- Next: the same flow for the till, and inside our Android and iOS apps.

TODAY'S CALL
Vesopa =C3=97 Dojo: Hosted Payments for EPOS, Online Menu, Android & iOS
Thursday 15 October 2026, 1:30pm to 2pm UK time (BST)
Join with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/bfd-qjtp-xkt
Or dial: (US) +1 617-675-4444 PIN: 462 307 910 8918#
More phone numbers: https://tel.meet/bfd-qjtp-xkt?pin=3D4623079108918
The calendar invite comes separately from Google Calendar.

What we would like to cover:
1. A short demo: an order on our online menu paid on Dojo's hosted checkout, =
reaching the till only once it is paid
2. Hosted payments in Vesopa EPOS: a pay link or QR code from the till for ta=
ble, phone and collection orders
3. Paying in our Android and iOS apps: memberships, top-ups and orders, with =
Apple Pay and Google Pay on Dojo's page
4. Webhooks for payment intents, refunds from the back office, reporting, and=
 live keys for go-live

If anything else would help to see on the call, just reply and we will have i=
t ready.

Thank you again for all your help. We look forward to speaking with you at 1:=
30pm.

Kind regards,
Muzahid Islam
Developer, Vesopa Software Ltd
muzahid@vesopa.com

On behalf of Meirion Davies, Director
Vesopa Software Ltd and Vesopa Ltd
